"A Wooden Bridge"
"This bridge is huge, stretching from a narrow ledge on the cliffs to the south

to a small island to the north.  The rough planks are sturdy and the bridge

appears wide enough to accommodate a wagon.  Far below, the waters of the

Inner Sea pound the cliffs and the rocks around the island.

"
