"3 wooden 3 bridge 3 planks"
"The bridge is constructed almost entirely from wood, save for the huge bolts

and bracings that hold the beams together.  The planks that make the surface

of the bridge are rough wood, but appear to be newly laid as they are yet

unweathered.

"
E
"3 island 3 north"
"A small island of stone juts from the surface of the sea.  A stone

fortification has been built on the shore of the island where the bridge meets

the land.  The gates, however, stand wide open, and the roofs of several

buildings can be seen over the top of the wall.  One structure, a large

citadel of dark stone, towers over the others and appears to stand in the

center of the isle.

"
