#92006
"Before a Fortress of Dark Stone"
"A tall, ominous building constructed of a dark colored stone towers over the

other structures of the island.  Its walls continue for hundreds of feet in

either direction, broken only by a single portal set into the center of the

wall.  No other buildings have been constructed close to the fortress; its

isolation only makes it appear larger and more menacing.  A stone-paved road

leads away from the fortress toward a crossroads south of here.

"
