"3 stone 3 walls 3 building 3 fortress"
"Large, interlocking blocks of a darkish stone, possibly granite, have been

fitted almost seemlessly into place to form this building.  Each block looks

to weigh several tons and the faces have been polished smooth to prevent

scaling.  The building is immense and topped with crenelated battlements.  It

is obviously key to the defense of this small island.

"
