#92007
"Inside a Fortress of Dark Stone"
"Murder holes in the ceiling indicate that this stronghold was built chiefly

for defense.  The hallways are narrow and barely high enough for a troll to

stand in upright.  Though the floor has been polished smooth, the walls have

been left rough and undecorated.  A single heavy door has been set into the

walls in every direction, each made of heavy wooden planks and banded with

iron.

"
