#92008
"Great Hall"
"This room is large and open with high ceilings and a large fireplace built

into the eastern and western walls.  The fires illuminate the room dimly and

seem to be the only sources of light in the hall.  A long wooden table ringed

with benches stands in the center of the room, laden with food.  The southern

wall has a reinforced wooden door set into it, while the northern wall is only

blank stone, save for a button shaped like a skull on the corner.

"
"[Olah] to armory, 92009

